WEBVTT

00:00:04.749 --> 00:00:08.253
Carry... The other personality
which has awakened...

00:00:08.253 --> 00:00:12.824
within the heart of Comerican
astronaut Capt. Caroline McGee...

00:00:12.824 --> 00:00:15.452
And from his behavior,
he still has feelings for her.

00:00:15.794 --> 00:00:18.196
Minamoto, you have a vital role to play...

00:00:18.196 --> 00:00:20.832
as the knight who protects
The Children's future.

00:00:20.832 --> 00:00:23.068
Did you forget that?

00:00:23.068 --> 00:00:25.770
You're causing me a lot of trouble!

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:29.207
Director. We're about to arrive at
the start point over the ocean.

00:00:29.207 --> 00:00:30.868
Right. Thanks.

00:00:31.343 --> 00:00:33.912
I may not be able to do Mach 2, like Aoi,

00:00:33.912 --> 00:00:35.937
but Fujiko Tsubomi is moving out!

00:00:40.518 --> 00:00:47.617
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:00:48.626 --> 00:00:54.496
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:56.935 --> 00:01:02.737
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:07.943
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:09.214 --> 00:01:14.743
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:15.153 --> 00:01:19.749
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:01:20.358 --> 00:01:23.261
Limiter (changing myself)

00:01:23.261 --> 00:01:26.389
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:32.265
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:01:33.705 --> 00:01:36.274
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:01:36.274 --> 00:01:39.107
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:01:39.344 --> 00:01:45.510
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:48.453
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:01:48.453 --> 00:01:51.089
Sora e karitateru yo

00:01:51.089 --> 00:01:56.823
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:01:57.162 --> 00:02:02.691
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:11.276 --> 00:02:14.040
44th sense:
"Painful Parting! Goodbye Forever, Carry"

00:02:15.313 --> 00:02:18.305
Excuse me. I have your breakfast.

00:02:18.683 --> 00:02:21.186
So, what'll it be, Mister?
Crack your skull open?

00:02:21.186 --> 00:02:22.520
Bury you underground?

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:24.283
Lethal wounds to your mind?

00:02:24.622 --> 00:02:26.124
What'll it be?

00:02:26.124 --> 00:02:27.648
You're kidding, right? Ha, ha, ha!

00:02:27.725 --> 00:02:29.027
Ha, ha, ha! No, we aren't.

00:02:29.027 --> 00:02:31.362
Not after being locked
up in here all night!

00:02:31.362 --> 00:02:35.467
Even with our limiters engaged,
we still have Level 4 powers!

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:37.264
Ready, set... KABOOM!

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:40.105
Excuse me!

00:02:40.105 --> 00:02:42.907
We were kidding. It's not like we'd do that.

00:02:42.907 --> 00:02:44.499
Although we make an
exception for Mr. Minamoto.

00:02:44.776 --> 00:02:50.180
Oh, yeah! He's gonna get it!
Psychic Ass-Kicking!

00:02:51.116 --> 00:02:53.585
I wonder what he's doing now.

00:02:53.585 --> 00:02:57.885
Being away from him,
it feels kind of like the old days.

00:02:59.657 --> 00:03:01.454
We know you're watching us, Chief!

00:03:01.659 --> 00:03:05.425
Just let us out already!
I promise, we'll behave!

00:03:05.964 --> 00:03:07.832
I know! Here, I'll give you this!

00:03:07.832 --> 00:03:10.502
My special bagged
mega-boobulous babe issue!

00:03:10.502 --> 00:03:13.938
I can't take it anymore!
Turn off the monitor, right now!

00:03:14.339 --> 00:03:16.204
R-Roger!

00:03:18.009 --> 00:03:21.274
Forgive me, my gallant Children!
This is hard for me, too!

00:03:21.346 --> 00:03:23.114
Even so, the cabinet decided...

00:03:23.114 --> 00:03:26.743
to leave this all to the Comerican team,
but how do we...

00:03:26.818 --> 00:03:29.378
And where did the director
go at a time like this?!

00:03:29.754 --> 00:03:30.550
Chief!

00:03:33.892 --> 00:03:34.859
What?!

00:03:34.859 --> 00:03:38.530
The old lady's personal helicopter
isn't in the hangar?!

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.632
Not so loud!

00:03:40.632 --> 00:03:43.635
Sorry. But, you don't think she'd!

00:03:43.635 --> 00:03:48.072
Minamoto, making those kids worry...
You're the real bad guy here.

00:03:49.774 --> 00:03:50.909
Well?

00:03:50.909 --> 00:03:52.710
Looks like they turned off the monitor.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.871
I can't tell anything more specific on their end.

00:03:56.247 --> 00:03:59.614
All right, then now's the
time to for us to use "it"!

00:04:00.385 --> 00:04:01.477
What "it"?

00:04:09.928 --> 00:04:16.800
Forgive me, Kaoru, Aoi, Shiho.
Everyone at BABEL. But, I...

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.673
I can't turn Carry over without knowing why.

00:04:21.673 --> 00:04:26.303
But at this rate, Caroline's dream of
going into space will be lost, too.

00:04:26.978 --> 00:04:29.970
What should I do?!

00:04:31.916 --> 00:04:33.518
Good morning, Koichi.

00:04:33.518 --> 00:04:34.746
Good morning, Carry.

00:04:35.353 --> 00:04:38.623
What's wrong, Koichi? Were you
lonely while Carry was asleep?

00:04:38.623 --> 00:04:39.590
There, there.

00:04:41.893 --> 00:04:45.763
Carry, listen to me.
This isn't natural. For your sake...

00:04:45.763 --> 00:04:47.565
I know. Let's go!

00:04:47.565 --> 00:04:48.930
Huh? H-Hold on!

00:04:57.675 --> 00:04:59.040
Ow!

00:05:00.645 --> 00:05:03.307
It just came out of the fryer.
Blow on it, like this.

00:05:10.288 --> 00:05:12.779
It's sweet! I've never tasted anything like it.

00:05:14.025 --> 00:05:15.617
Now this way!

00:05:16.661 --> 00:05:18.822
Carry, listen to me. We...

00:05:20.832 --> 00:05:23.357
You don't like it?

00:05:24.769 --> 00:05:27.670
You don't like being with Carry?

00:05:28.039 --> 00:05:30.769
Carry wanted to go on a date
with you in Japan so much!

00:05:31.075 --> 00:05:34.306
She wanted to see where you were born!
With her own eyes!

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:52.028
Koichi, hurry up!

00:05:58.202 --> 00:06:00.397
It's you! Itarsha!

00:06:01.272 --> 00:06:04.609
Look how quiet those three have gotten.

00:06:04.609 --> 00:06:06.702
Yes. Do you think they understand now?

00:06:07.178 --> 00:06:09.981
Come on, let's go to Hanamatsu together.

00:06:09.981 --> 00:06:10.970
Right!

00:06:13.318 --> 00:06:17.955
Well, I had Kugutsu make those dolls
long ago in case this happened.

00:06:17.955 --> 00:06:21.220
Don't lie. You had him make them
for some creepy plan you had.

00:06:22.093 --> 00:06:23.161
You could tell?

00:06:23.161 --> 00:06:25.363
But, are we really going?

00:06:25.363 --> 00:06:29.094
If Mr. Minamoto chooses Carry over us...

00:06:30.535 --> 00:06:32.935
What will we do then?

00:06:33.371 --> 00:06:35.206
Well, Kaoru? Shiho?

00:06:35.206 --> 00:06:36.474
Aoi...

00:06:36.474 --> 00:06:39.444
I don't know, either. But...

00:06:39.444 --> 00:06:43.380
But I can't just stand by and do nothing!

00:06:48.386 --> 00:06:50.722
Just a cold. Here's some medicine.

00:06:50.722 --> 00:06:52.256
Oh, really?

00:06:52.256 --> 00:06:53.621
Thank goodness, Hotaru!

00:06:54.959 --> 00:06:58.329
Oh, yeah! We found a great sweets shop!

00:06:58.329 --> 00:07:00.763
Why don't you come with us? Our treat!

00:07:01.199 --> 00:07:03.901
I appreciate the concern, you two.

00:07:03.901 --> 00:07:06.096
Let me treat you another time.

00:07:07.839 --> 00:07:09.568
Tell us if anything happens, okay?

00:07:09.874 --> 00:07:10.704
Sure.

00:07:15.113 --> 00:07:17.815
Who'd be calling this number? Hello?

00:07:17.815 --> 00:07:20.477
Hi. How're things with you, Captain Group Date?

00:07:20.718 --> 00:07:22.987
What?! Director, is that you?!

00:07:22.987 --> 00:07:23.851
Bingo!

00:07:24.222 --> 00:07:27.392
I see. So, when the Comericans capture Carry...

00:07:27.392 --> 00:07:29.394
Yeah, they apparently intend to restart...

00:07:29.394 --> 00:07:31.729
the high-level esper development experiments.

00:07:31.729 --> 00:07:34.332
Fujiko, honey...
But Carry's personality was created
purely by an experimental accident.

00:07:34.332 --> 00:07:36.768
But Carry's personality was created
purely by an experimental accident.

00:07:36.768 --> 00:07:39.103
And even if she has awakened again, this time...

00:07:39.103 --> 00:07:43.474
Securing talented espers is a top-level
concern for all the world's nations.

00:07:43.474 --> 00:07:46.844
Our leaders have always thought that,
both now and in the past.

00:07:46.844 --> 00:07:48.579
So, what do you want me to do?

00:07:48.579 --> 00:07:51.349
Not sure. Oh, by the way, Shuji, dear.

00:07:51.349 --> 00:07:54.614
I played a little joke with that
precious file you keep in your desk.

00:07:55.119 --> 00:07:59.112
Concentrate on your work instead of
gathering data on girls for once, okay?

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:02.891
W-Wait! What did she!

00:08:03.494 --> 00:08:05.863
Neither Kiritsubo nor I can make a move.

00:08:05.863 --> 00:08:09.167
It's up to you. Buy us some time
until we can do something.

00:08:09.167 --> 00:08:11.397
See you around, Professor Wonlens.

00:08:12.069 --> 00:08:13.400
Fujiko, honey...

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:25.014
Oh, it looks so good on you!

00:08:26.818 --> 00:08:28.308
This is cute!

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:31.756
Now you can't use your ESP.

00:08:31.756 --> 00:08:36.090
Come with us quietly, Captain Caroline.
Or should I call you Carry?

00:08:36.427 --> 00:08:39.624
Don't you try anything, either,
and we won't have to hurt...

00:08:40.398 --> 00:08:41.729
Carry, run!

00:08:50.007 --> 00:08:50.769
Koichi.

00:08:51.642 --> 00:08:54.634
Don't worry. I won't let them hurt you.

00:08:55.213 --> 00:08:56.612
Cool line.

00:08:56.981 --> 00:08:59.108
You should try it on the girls.

00:08:59.984 --> 00:09:00.541
Who are?!

00:09:02.787 --> 00:09:04.584
Hyobu? Why are you here?!

00:09:04.822 --> 00:09:09.555
Why not? As the leader of PANDRA,
I'm always looking for espers to join.

00:09:10.161 --> 00:09:12.830
Especially girls being hounded
by the detestable BABEL.

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:14.855
When you think about it,
it's no mystery why I'm here.

00:09:16.634 --> 00:09:17.760
Go to it, everyone.

00:09:20.004 --> 00:09:21.272
Let's go!

00:09:21.272 --> 00:09:23.433
GIANT SWING TELEPORTATION PUNCH!

00:09:24.542 --> 00:09:28.412
Go forth! 1:1 Scale Manzoku
Grade Moga-chan Mk. II!

00:09:28.412 --> 00:09:30.710
As you wish, Master!

00:09:30.915 --> 00:09:32.382
BIG MAGNUM!

00:09:34.785 --> 00:09:38.414
Whoops! Learn to play gentle,
or you'll never get a girl!

00:09:38.589 --> 00:09:40.784
Hey! Make some effort, for once!

00:09:40.892 --> 00:09:41.824
Right, right.

00:09:43.094 --> 00:09:45.730
The Queen and the others can't
do anything about this.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:50.190
But us making trouble won't cause
any diplomatic problems, will it?

00:09:50.434 --> 00:09:51.958
Hyobu, you...

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.195
Come.

00:09:59.911 --> 00:10:03.447
Don't be afraid. I'm a friend.

00:10:03.447 --> 00:10:04.749
Yeah, yeah!

00:10:04.749 --> 00:10:06.984
Oh, Kyosuke, I'm so happy.

00:10:06.984 --> 00:10:09.646
You're finally ridding yourself
of the whole lolicon thing!

00:10:10.488 --> 00:10:12.285
Dammit, you're making me look suspicious!

00:10:12.523 --> 00:10:15.185
Were you the one who awakened Carry?

00:10:15.693 --> 00:10:20.153
Don't badmouth me.
I don't know the reason, either.

00:10:20.665 --> 00:10:22.500
What I do know...

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:25.736
is that you really need to hear my proposal.

00:10:25.736 --> 00:10:26.600
Proposal?

00:10:33.311 --> 00:10:34.869
Cat.

00:10:37.915 --> 00:10:39.883
Love is wonderful!

00:10:40.551 --> 00:10:43.645
The Children have escaped!
A-Team, secure them at once!

00:10:43.721 --> 00:10:44.488
Kaoru!

00:10:44.488 --> 00:10:47.658
Repeat, The Children have escaped!
A-Team, secure them at once!
Damn, it didn't take them long to notice!

00:10:47.658 --> 00:10:49.894
Repeat, The Children have escaped!
A-Team, secure them at once!
This way!

00:10:49.894 --> 00:10:50.690
This way!

00:10:50.962 --> 00:10:52.793
It's hard to play such a thankless role, isn't it?

00:10:52.897 --> 00:10:54.660
It's not just about the diplomatic concerns.

00:10:54.732 --> 00:10:57.568
If BABEL loses influence
because of this incident...

00:10:57.568 --> 00:10:59.937
It could place every esper in this country...

00:10:59.937 --> 00:11:01.962
in an even more precarious position.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.675
Report from from our spy sat!

00:11:04.675 --> 00:11:06.802
A massive ESP response has
been picked up in the city!

00:11:08.846 --> 00:11:09.676
PANDRA!

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:18.120
Oh, crap! Mio-Mio, pull back!

00:11:19.023 --> 00:11:20.149
Come on!

00:11:22.259 --> 00:11:24.228
Damn! I didn't expect them!

00:11:24.228 --> 00:11:27.925
Look for the captain!
We can't fail the president!

00:11:28.299 --> 00:11:30.267
Minamoto, do you know what awaits that girl...

00:11:30.267 --> 00:11:32.603
if you hand her over to
the Comerican government?

00:11:32.603 --> 00:11:37.108
I'm sure you can imagine.
I don't want that for her, either.

00:11:37.108 --> 00:11:38.905
So, why not work together?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:44.415
You both can come to our hideout.
Then you can happily live together.

00:11:44.415 --> 00:11:45.245
Koichi?

00:11:45.483 --> 00:11:48.714
I think it's what you would want, too.

00:11:52.123 --> 00:11:54.557
What I want?

00:11:55.126 --> 00:11:56.616
That's ridiculous!

00:12:02.266 --> 00:12:02.994
Carry!

00:12:07.071 --> 00:12:09.335
You crept up on me without
my sensing anything.

00:12:09.607 --> 00:12:11.632
Impressive, Esper Killer.

00:12:11.809 --> 00:12:14.979
She's a Comerican esper. We'll be taking her.

00:12:14.979 --> 00:12:17.715
Resist, and you'll have us to deal with!

00:12:17.715 --> 00:12:18.704
No mercy!

00:12:18.949 --> 00:12:19.916
Koichi!

00:12:21.085 --> 00:12:25.283
Interesting. You up for a fight?
It's been decades since our last.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.984
Response still coming in from Odaiba!

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.728
Minamoto must still be there.

00:12:32.396 --> 00:12:34.165
Hold it, Sakaki!

00:12:34.165 --> 00:12:35.655
Um, well...

00:12:36.233 --> 00:12:37.902
Is everyone fighting me?

00:12:37.902 --> 00:12:38.459
Chief?

00:12:38.669 --> 00:12:40.037
Of course!

00:12:40.037 --> 00:12:42.073
Now that Hyobu and PANDRA
are causing trouble,

00:12:42.073 --> 00:12:45.201
isn't it only natural for us to
send out our special espers?!

00:12:46.811 --> 00:12:50.381
Sakaki, I am temporarily reassigning
you to be a supervisor.

00:12:50.381 --> 00:12:53.617
You will lead The Children and deal
with this in the usual manner.

00:12:53.617 --> 00:12:54.952
The usual manner.

00:12:54.952 --> 00:12:56.153
Chief...

00:12:56.153 --> 00:12:58.756
And be sure to tell the director that, too.

00:12:58.756 --> 00:12:59.814
Roger that!

00:13:01.892 --> 00:13:03.194
Now what?

00:13:03.194 --> 00:13:05.958
Even if we get outside, what will we do?

00:13:09.934 --> 00:13:11.231
Dr. Sakaki!

00:13:12.903 --> 00:13:14.700
Lemme show you something cool.

00:13:15.673 --> 00:13:16.373
That's!

00:13:16.373 --> 00:13:17.237
How?

00:13:18.509 --> 00:13:20.602
The director arranged it.

00:13:20.811 --> 00:13:22.676
You can release our limiters?

00:13:22.913 --> 00:13:26.016
Yup. For today, I'm your on-site supervisor.

00:13:26.016 --> 00:13:28.576
Now, let's get to Minamoto
and Carry, fast as we can!

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:30.648
Right!

00:13:36.727 --> 00:13:38.062
Not bad.

00:13:38.062 --> 00:13:40.326
Because your own powers are so great.

00:13:43.968 --> 00:13:46.604
Oh, I might hit the colonel.

00:13:46.604 --> 00:13:48.094
Heh, you're pathetic!

00:13:49.006 --> 00:13:51.065
Now, that's marksmanship!

00:13:51.308 --> 00:13:53.344
Let her go, or else I'll!

00:13:53.344 --> 00:13:57.148
What? And what can you do with no ESP at all?

00:13:57.148 --> 00:14:00.117
Don't underestimate me!
Have you heard this story?

00:14:00.584 --> 00:14:02.753
Once upon a time, there was an
old man who went for firewood...

00:14:02.753 --> 00:14:04.812
on a mountain while his wife
did their laundry in the river.

00:14:05.055 --> 00:14:08.993
Oh, no! It's like a bedtime story!
You're lulling me to sleep?!

00:14:08.993 --> 00:14:10.688
My powers!

00:14:11.862 --> 00:14:13.955
Actually, I just have a mini-ECM.

00:14:18.769 --> 00:14:19.737
Koichi.

00:14:19.737 --> 00:14:21.364
Thank goodness. You're not hurt?

00:14:21.639 --> 00:14:23.869
You lose.

00:14:24.775 --> 00:14:27.335
I was waiting for you to believe
you'd won so you'd get sloppy.

00:14:27.578 --> 00:14:29.580
You've given me your power!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.672
My Hypno?

00:14:32.316 --> 00:14:33.214
Carry?

00:14:34.285 --> 00:14:37.812
I will erase your memories and you
will be reborn as a new person.

00:14:38.289 --> 00:14:40.457
No one will have to chase you anymore.

00:14:40.457 --> 00:14:43.561
Now, live the remainder of your life in peace.

00:14:43.561 --> 00:14:46.860
You old bastard...
You planned this from the start!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:50.830
No!

00:14:52.236 --> 00:14:55.439
There's something I want to know for sure!

00:14:55.439 --> 00:14:58.542
About Koichi... It's why I had to awaken!

00:14:58.542 --> 00:15:00.377
Carry's back!

00:15:00.377 --> 00:15:02.780
I won't stay very much longer.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.271
Please, leave me my memories to the end!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.384
Fine.

00:15:07.384 --> 00:15:11.021
In deference to her feelings and my
own rebellion against my nation,

00:15:11.021 --> 00:15:13.190
I'll withdraw.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:17.718
I won't tell the queen,
but you owe me for this, kid!

00:15:18.028 --> 00:15:18.926
Hyobu...

00:15:22.499 --> 00:15:24.296
Carry. You...

00:15:27.705 --> 00:15:29.172
Hold it!

00:15:32.009 --> 00:15:34.534
Get back! We're taking that girl into custody!

00:15:35.479 --> 00:15:37.276
No, you aren't!

00:15:40.117 --> 00:15:41.619
All right, let's do this!

00:15:41.619 --> 00:15:42.551
Right!

00:15:42.786 --> 00:15:44.310
Sakaki, and...

00:15:44.555 --> 00:15:46.857
Special espers, The Children. Released!

00:15:46.857 --> 00:15:47.323
<<RELEASED>>
Special espers, The Children. Released!

00:15:49.693 --> 00:15:51.862
No matter how tight the pinch, we won't give up!

00:15:51.862 --> 00:15:54.198
That's the absolutely lovely maiden's policy!

00:15:54.198 --> 00:15:57.998
With love and pain in our hearts,
now our power awakens and overflows!

00:15:58.269 --> 00:16:00.362
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:03.572
Special espers?!

00:16:03.807 --> 00:16:07.038
PSYCHIC LOVE FIRST AID!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.382
Why, you!

00:16:11.382 --> 00:16:13.782
PSYCHIC AEGIS SHIELD!

00:16:18.389 --> 00:16:19.287
You!

00:16:19.523 --> 00:16:20.615
Gotcha! Gotcha! Gotcha! Gotcha!

00:16:23.661 --> 00:16:25.891
For your own health, you should surrender.

00:16:28.432 --> 00:16:30.525
You must be!

00:16:35.239 --> 00:16:37.298
Don't just stand there! Go, Minamoto!

00:16:38.742 --> 00:16:41.939
Leave this to us. You two, go hide somewhere.

00:16:42.446 --> 00:16:44.243
You'll just be in the way here!

00:16:44.682 --> 00:16:45.649
Kaoru...

00:16:45.649 --> 00:16:46.513
Thank you.

00:16:50.421 --> 00:16:51.615
Kaoru.

00:16:52.156 --> 00:16:55.751
Are you agent Albert? You've got a phone call.

00:16:57.094 --> 00:16:58.823
For me?

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:00.662
Mr. President!

00:17:00.998 --> 00:17:02.693
Withdraw at once.

00:17:03.167 --> 00:17:04.969
Your unit is disbanded.

00:17:04.969 --> 00:17:07.665
Our nation will disavow all knowledge of you.

00:17:08.205 --> 00:17:09.006
What's the meaning of this?!

00:17:09.006 --> 00:17:10.303
Exactly what it sounds like!

00:17:11.608 --> 00:17:14.411
Is... Is that what you wanted, Fujiko, darling?!

00:17:14.411 --> 00:17:16.246
Okay. We're even, now.

00:17:16.246 --> 00:17:18.680
And my wife won't find out
about that little matter, right?

00:17:18.882 --> 00:17:22.648
It'll be fine! We're old friends, aren't we?

00:17:23.921 --> 00:17:25.752
Your job's done.

00:17:32.029 --> 00:17:35.766
Japan is a nice place. I had fun today.

00:17:35.766 --> 00:17:37.199
Carry, what are you...

00:17:37.267 --> 00:17:37.961
Koichi.

00:17:38.802 --> 00:17:42.863
Do you remember our last day,
when I entered your mind?

00:17:44.742 --> 00:17:46.607
How could I forget?

00:17:47.411 --> 00:17:48.605
Goodbye.

00:17:57.388 --> 00:18:00.050
This is the interior of Koichi's heart.

00:18:07.564 --> 00:18:09.191
Why are you crying?

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:13.427
I don't understand.
I don't understand, so I'm sad.

00:18:15.005 --> 00:18:18.532
Please, stop crying inside of your heart.

00:18:18.809 --> 00:18:21.145
It doesn't matter if you don't understand.

00:18:21.145 --> 00:18:22.874
If you're sad, then be sad.

00:18:24.314 --> 00:18:26.850
But don't cry alone.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:30.308
There are people in this world who love you.

00:18:30.888 --> 00:18:33.049
So, if you need to cry, let's cry together.

00:18:33.557 --> 00:18:36.890
I'll stay in here with you, Koichi.

00:18:37.694 --> 00:18:41.186
This is all that I can give you.

00:18:45.335 --> 00:18:47.064
Carry. You...

00:18:47.738 --> 00:18:50.468
I don't want to be a bother to you and Caroline.

00:18:51.008 --> 00:18:53.272
I love you, Koichi.

00:19:02.486 --> 00:19:03.612
Carry!

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:08.759
A bond must have existed
between the two of you...

00:19:08.759 --> 00:19:10.522
since before you were even born.

00:19:11.395 --> 00:19:13.030
I wanted to see it.

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:16.124
The face of the girl you were destined for.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.635
That's why I stayed inside of Caroline until now.

00:19:18.635 --> 00:19:20.068
Carry, what are you...

00:19:22.139 --> 00:19:24.573
I'm glad I could see you again one last time.

00:19:25.008 --> 00:19:26.168
Thank you, Koichi.

00:19:28.378 --> 00:19:31.779
I have to go. Caroline says
she wants to wake up now.

00:19:32.549 --> 00:19:33.516
Carry.

00:19:35.552 --> 00:19:38.589
I'll still be inside of Caroline,

00:19:38.589 --> 00:19:41.258
but I'll never awaken again, so this is goodbye.

00:19:41.258 --> 00:19:43.627
I probably won't remember you in my sleep,

00:19:43.627 --> 00:19:46.263
but perhaps I'll dream about you.

00:19:46.263 --> 00:19:49.289
So, let it be that way.
We'll meet in our dreams.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:54.733
Carry will become an angel who
will stand at your side. Always.

00:19:57.908 --> 00:20:00.103
Minamoto! Is Carry?!

00:20:03.747 --> 00:20:05.738
She's gone.

00:20:09.219 --> 00:20:10.988
Huh? Where am I?

00:20:10.988 --> 00:20:12.250
Caroline.

00:20:12.723 --> 00:20:16.489
Oh. It's Minamoto, right?
What are you doing here?

00:20:20.898 --> 00:20:23.901
Three... Two... One...

00:20:23.901 --> 00:20:24.868
Lift off!

00:20:33.577 --> 00:20:34.976
Oh, Minamoto...

00:20:35.312 --> 00:20:39.383
You're wondering why he didn't say
"Don't go!" or " Don't disappear"?

00:20:39.383 --> 00:20:41.817
If he loved her, why hold anything back?

00:20:42.085 --> 00:20:43.453
They had no choice.

00:20:43.453 --> 00:20:46.581
They couldn't just sacrifice
Caroline's life and dreams.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.256
Carry wouldn't have wanted that, right?

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:51.627
I know that!

00:20:52.663 --> 00:20:56.463
But I want to hear it!
Even if it's not right, I still want to!

00:20:59.002 --> 00:21:02.563
If it were for the most important
person in the world,

00:21:02.639 --> 00:21:04.766
I would have said it...

00:21:08.679 --> 00:21:09.543
Carry.

00:21:14.585 --> 00:21:16.519
I was the one who wanted wings!

00:21:16.587 --> 00:21:19.249
Even though I had to conceal it from you!

00:21:21.892 --> 00:21:25.487
I didn't tell you then or now.
I couldn't tell you.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.064
Oh, thanks for seeing her off...

00:21:41.645 --> 00:21:45.082
You'd better not just ignore her.
She's in a bad mood.

00:21:45.082 --> 00:21:47.451
Basically, she's totally jealous.

00:21:47.451 --> 00:21:48.352
I see.

00:21:48.352 --> 00:21:51.321
Don't just say "I see"!
Say something different, you jerk!

00:21:51.555 --> 00:21:53.352
This is why you're such a loser!

00:21:54.091 --> 00:21:56.627
Oh... I get mad and you act like I'm being stupid!

00:21:56.627 --> 00:21:58.925
What is your problem?!

00:21:59.963 --> 00:22:02.295
If I had to do it over...

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:06.303
could I say it?

00:22:06.303 --> 00:22:09.500
That all I need is you.

00:22:20.851 --> 00:22:24.488
Mae wo muite Yume wo daite

00:22:24.488 --> 00:22:28.458
Kokoro kimete Miageru sora

00:22:28.458 --> 00:22:34.531
Mirai wo koeru Watashi no tsubasa de

00:22:34.531 --> 00:22:38.402
Anata dake ga daihon'me!

00:22:38.402 --> 00:22:42.372
Zettai love! Sengen shita

00:22:42.372 --> 00:22:48.277
Kira-kira shiteta kisetsu ga sugiteku

00:22:49.012 --> 00:22:53.050
Kinen shashin no anata wa

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:56.918
Kawaranai komarikao

00:22:57.521 --> 00:23:03.756
Yasashikutte atatakakute namida ga dechau

00:23:04.961 --> 00:23:08.532
Ashita mo koko de aeru mitai ni

00:23:08.532 --> 00:23:12.102
Yakusoku shinaide yukou

00:23:12.102 --> 00:23:16.073
Itsumo no you ni sarigenaku

00:23:16.073 --> 00:23:21.306
Egao de chiisaku te wo futta

00:23:22.312 --> 00:23:27.113
"Jaa... Mata ne"

00:23:40.997 --> 00:23:41.031
Next Episode

00:23:41.031 --> 00:23:41.932
Next Episode
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.932 --> 00:23:43.229
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.734 --> 00:23:45.035
You're all espers?

00:23:45.035 --> 00:23:47.471
Yeah, Level 7... I mean, 2!

00:23:47.471 --> 00:23:50.565
The teacher said you wanted
to talk to us, Takeshi.

00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:52.542
So, anyway, nice to meet you!

00:23:52.542 --> 00:23:55.409
The thing is, they're not sure
if I'm an esper or not.

00:23:55.846 --> 00:23:57.247
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:57.247 --> 00:24:00.478
Episode 45: "Natural Talents are Natural!
Gift of Children!"

00:24:00.617 --> 00:24:03.381
Espers are our greatest enemies, bar none!

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:06.189
ESP is destroying the world!

00:24:06.189 --> 00:24:06.690
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.690 --> 00:24:08.458
Natural Talents are Natural!
Gift of Children
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.458 --> 00:24:09.925
Natural Talents are Natural!
Gift of Children
